  user_input {
    user_response: "create clone of all streaming app add social sharing features and offline playback support and a personalized recommendation engine based on user history.and include a dark mode interface for better accessibility.and prioritize cross-platform compatibility across mobile and desktop devices.and ensure high-quality streaming performance with adaptive bitrate technology.and include robust security measures to protect user data and content privacy.and implement social sharing buttons so users can easily broadcast their favorite content.and offer offline viewing capabilities for on-the-go access.and include a personalized recommendation engine based on user viewing history.and integrate a comprehensive search tool for discovering new titles.and include a dark mode option for enhanced night viewing.and include push notifications for new episode updates and trending releases.and incorporate social sharing features to connect with friends and community members.and include offline downloading capabilities for watching content without an active internet connection.and get source all video from https://nxsha.space and create watch party with and create watch party couple also"
    items {
      item {
        text_block {
          content: "---\ntype: \"feature\"\ntitle: \"Add Gemini intelligence\"\nicon: \"spark\"\n---\n\nYou MUST add Gemini to the app where relevant to complete all sorts of tasks - analyze content, make edits, and more. These are suggested ideas. Use gemini-4-argon for complex tasks, gemini-3.8-flash for general tasks, and gemini-3.1-flash-lite for tasks that should happen fast."
        }
      }
    }
    items {
      item {
        text_block {
          content: "---\ntype: \"feature\"\ntitle: \"Enable high thinking\"\nicon: \"network_intelligence\"\n---\n\nYou MUST add thinking mode to the app where relevant to handle users\' most complex queries. You MUST use the gemini-4-argon model and set `thinkingLevel` to `ThinkingLevel.HIGH`. Do not set `maxOutputTokens`."
        }
      }
    }
    items {
      item {
        text_block {
          content: "---\ntype: \"feature\"\ntitle: \"Add voice conversations\"\nicon: \"audio_spark\"\n---\n\nAdd functionality to the app for users to use model gemini-3.8-live (Live API) in their app. This will allow users to have a conversation with the app and get responses from Live API in real-time."
        }
      }
    }
    items {
      text: "create clone of all streaming app add social sharing features and offline playback support and a personalized recommendation engine based on user history.and include a dark mode interface for better accessibility.and prioritize cross-platform compatibility across mobile and desktop devices.and ensure high-quality streaming performance with adaptive bitrate technology.and include robust security measures to protect user data and content privacy.and implement social sharing buttons so users can easily broadcast their favorite content.and offer offline viewing capabilities for on-the-go access.and include a personalized recommendation engine based on user viewing history.and integrate a comprehensive search tool for discovering new titles.and include a dark mode option for enhanced night viewing.and include push notifications for new episode updates and trending releases.and incorporate social sharing features to connect with friends and community members.and include offline downloading capabilities for watching content without an active internet connection.and get source all video from https://nxsha.space and create watch party with and create watch party couple also"
    }
  }
}
