  planner_response {
    thinking: "**Investigating Site Resources**\n\nI\'m now checking `https://nxsha.space` to identify available videos, content, or APIs. It\'s crucial to understand what resources are accessible there. Also, I must recall the `frontend-design` skill\'s Phase 1 instruction to issue all `generate_image` calls in a single turn. No delays.\n\n\n**Expanding Resource Inventory**\n\nI\'m now focusing on resource discovery. I\'ve initiated calls to install `ws`, `@types/ws`, and potentially `hls.js` for WebSocket functionality and adaptive bitrate video playback. My next step is to execute a `curl` command against `https://nxsha.space` to analyze its content and identify potential integration points, like real sources, embeds, or even direct playable streams. The goal is to maximize the site\'s utility.\n\n\n"
    tool_calls {
      id: "call_1501501"
