  planner_response {
    thinking: "**Generating the Catalog**\n\nI\'m currently focused on constructing `src/data/catalog.ts`. This involves seeding a rich catalog with real data from `https://nxsha.space/api/home-feed`, including entries like \'Clayface\', \'The Dog Stars\', and \'Wildwood\'. I\'m aiming to create a comprehensive and diverse initial dataset for the application.\n\n\n**Refining Video Playback**\n\nI\'m now deep in the `<AdaptiveVideoPlayer>` component design. My focus has shifted to ensuring robust video playback even in isolated environments. The core idea is to support direct HTML5 `<video>` elements, and I\'m adding resilience with a local stream generator (WebM/MP4 or Canvas capture + WebAudio) that dynamically creates a playable stream if external sources fail. This backup system should ensure the user always has a viewing experience.\n\n\n"
