      name: "replace_file_content"
      arguments_json: "{\"AllowMultiple\":false, \"Description\":\"Enforce 2-seat limit on Couple Watch Party rooms and clean editorial formatting in server.ts\", \"EndLine\":427, \"Instruction\":\"Update couple room seed and join handler in server.ts so Couple Watch Party strictly maintains 2 seats, and clean ### hashes from structuredAnalysis\", \"ReplacementContent\":\"    const structuredAnalysis = [\\n      `01. Thematic & Narrative Architecture \342\200\224 ${title || \'Featured Title\'}`,\\n      `At its core, ${title || \'this work\'} interrogates identity under extreme external pressure. Drawing from ${(genres || [\'Sci-Fi\', \'Thriller\']).join(\' and \')} traditions, the narrative structures each act around a progressive loss of certainty\342\200\224forcing the protagonist to choose between preservation of memory and radical adaptation.`,\\n      ``,\\n      `02. Cinematography & Acoustic Motifs`,\\n      `The visual grammar relies on high-contrast chiaroscuro lighting paired with anamorphic shallow depth-of-field. Notice how ambient acoustic textures\342\200\224rain on stone, low-frequency sub-bass resonance, and isolated dialogue tracks\342\200\224signal major plot reversals 15 seconds before they occur visually.`,\\n      ``,\\n      `03. ${mode === \'couple\' ? \'Couple Lounge Intimate\' : \'Group Watch Party\'} Discussion Prompts`,\\n      `\342\200\242 At what exact moment does the protagonist cross the moral event horizon, and would you have made the same trade?`,\\n      `\342\200\242 How does the director use architectural space to mirror the characters\' internal isolation?`,\\n      `\342\200\242 Which unresolved motif in the final act sets up the strongest trajectory for the next chapter?`,\\n    ].join(\'\\\\n\');\\n\\n    res.json({\\n      model: \'gemini-4-argon\',\\n      thinkingLevel: \'HIGH\',\\n      analysis: structuredAnalysis,\\n    });\\n  });\", \"StartLine\":405, \"TargetContent\":\"    const structuredAnalysis = [\\n      `### 1. Thematic & Narrative Architecture \342\200\224 ${title || \'Featured Title\'}`,\\n      `At its core, ${title || \'this work\'} interrogates identity under extreme external pressure. Drawing from ${(genres || [\'Sci-Fi\', \'Thriller\']).join(\' and \')} traditions, the narrative structures each act around a progressive loss of certainty\342\200\224forcing the protagonist to choose between preservation of memory and radical adaptation.`,\\n      ``,\\n      `### 2. Cinematography & Acoustic Motifs`,\\n      `The visual grammar relies on high-contrast chiaroscuro lighting paired with anamorphic shallow depth-of-field. Notice how ambient acoustic textures\342\200\224rain on stone, low-frequency sub-bass resonance, and isolated dialogue tracks\342\200\224signal major plot reversals 15 seconds before they occur visually.`,\\n      ``,\\n      `### 3. ${mode === \'couple\' ? \'Couple Lounge Intimate\' : \'Group Watch Party\'} Discussion Prompts`,\\n      `\342\200\242 At what exact moment does the protagonist cross the moral event horizon, and would you have made the same trade?`,\\n      `\342\200\242 How does the director use architectural space to mirror the characters\' internal isolation?`,\\n      `\342\200\242 Which unresolved motif in the final act sets up the strongest trajectory for the next chapter?`,\\n    ].join(\'\\\\n\');\\n\\n    res.json({\\n      model: \'gemini-4-argon\',\\n      thinkingLevel: \'HIGH\',\\n      analysis: structuredAnalysis,\\n    });\\n  });\", \"TargetFile\":\"/server.ts\", \"toolAction\":\"Cleaning editorial headings in server.ts analysis response\", \"toolSummary\":\"Clean editorial headings in server.ts\"}"
