  checkpoint {
    session_summary: "<summary>\n## 1. Task Overview\nThe user requested **CineTogether** (\"Different places. One screen. Shared moments.\"), a complete, responsive, production-oriented movie and TV social watch-party web application inspired by `https://aethoflix.world/` and `https://nxsha.space/`.\n- **Core Product Modes**:\n  1. **Couple Cinema Mode (\342\235\244\357\270\217)**: Private 2-participant room with romantic purple/rose/midnight-blue aesthetics, room states (`Waiting for partner`, `Partner joined`, `Selecting a movie`, `Ready to watch`, `Playing`, `Paused`, `Reconnecting`, `Session ended`), unique invite link & room code, optional password, 2 participant presence slots, shared movie selection, synchronized playback (where supported), real-time chat, emoji reactions & floating hearts (`\342\235\244\357\270\217 \360\237\230\202 \360\237\230\256 \360\237\230\242 \360\237\224\245`), shared watchlist, \"Next movie?\" voting, date-night themes, and leave/end controls.\n  2. **Friends & Group Cinema Mode (\360\237\216\211)**: Social cinema for 3\342\200\22320 participants (configurable capacity) with dark blue/violet aesthetics, host & moderator roles, collaborative control toggle, real-time group chat, emoji reactions, host transfer, movie voting, group watchlist, optional WebRTC audio/video chat with explicit permission & mute/push-to-talk controls, and host moderation (remove participant, lock room).\n- **Media Provider & Adapter Architecture**:\n  - Implement a dedicated `MediaProviderAdapter` interface (`getEmbedUrl()`, `initializePlayer()`, `play()`, `pause()`, `seekTo()`, `getCurrentTime()`, `getDuration()`, `onPlaybackEvent()`, `destroy()`).\n  - Support two provider types honestly:\n    1. **Licensed Sample / Local HTML5 Video Provider**: Supports full programmatic control (`play`, `pause`, `seekTo`, `getCurrentTime`, `getDuration`, `onPlaybackEvent`) and real frame-accurate WebSocket playback synchronization (`revision`, server timestamps, drift correction).\n    2. **Nxsha External Embed Provider (`https://nxsha.space/embed/movie/{mediaId}` and `/embed/tv/{mediaId}/{season}/{episode}`)**: Cross-origin iframe embed with season/episode selectors and a clearly labeled, honest `\"Sync unavailable for this external iframe player \342\200\224 use manual countdown / room coordination\"` indicator (never fake synchronization on cross-origin iframes).\n- **Required Pages / Routes (React Router)**:\n  1. Home (`/`) \342\200\224 Hero banner, Trending, Continue Watching, Popular this week, Recommended for you, Genres & languages, Recently added, Couple Night picks, Group Movie Night picks, instant Search.\n  2. Movies (`/movies`)\n  3. TV Shows (`/tv`)\n  4. Anime (`/anime`)\n  5. Search Results (`/search`)\n  6. Movie/Show Detail Page (`/media/:mediaType/:id`)\n  7. Create Watch Party (`/create-party`) \342\200\224 Displays two selectable cards: Couple Cinema vs Friends & Group Cinema.\n  8. Join Watch Party (`/join` and `/join/:roomCode`)\n  9. Couple Cinema Room (`/room/couple/:roomCode`)\n  10. Group Cinema Room (`/room/group/:roomCode`)\n  11. My Watchlist (`/watchlist`)\n  12. Profile & Preferences (`/profile`)\n  13. Authentication (`/auth` \342\200\224 Guest mode, Email/Password demo/session, and Google Sign-In via Firebase Auth)\n  14. Not Found (`/404` / `*`)\n\n## 2. Progress\n- **Skills Loaded**: Read `ultra-mode`, `frontend-design` (plus `3_saas_dashboard.md` and `10_mobile_touch_apps.md`), `gemini-api`, `real-time-and-multi-user`, `computer-use`, `cloudsql-setup`, `firebase-integration-rpc`, `cloudsql-update-schema`, and `cloudsql-execute-sql`.\n- **Cloud SQL & Firebase Auth Provisioned (COMPLETED)**:\n  - Verified eligibility via `cloudsql.CheckFeatureEligibility` (`eligible: true`).\n  - Obtained user approval (`Enable Cloud SQL in region asia-south1`).\n  - Provisioned Cloud SQL instance via `cloudsql.CreateInstance` (`instanceName: \"ai-studio-1c55159c\"`, `projectId: \"triple-vigil-qjwpf\"`).\n  - Provisioned Google OAuth via `set_up_oauth` (`/firebase-applet-config.json` generated at workspace root).\n- **Packages Installed (COMPLETED)**:\n  - `firebase`, `firebase-admin`, `drizzle-orm`, `drizzle-kit`, `pg`, `@types/pg`, `react-router-dom`, `ws`, `@types/ws`, `hls.js`, `lucide-react`, `motion`.\n- **Database & Auth Foundation Files Created & Verified (COMPLETED)**:\n  - `/src/lib/firebase.ts` \342\200\224 Firebase Client SDK setup with `auth` and `googleAuthProvider`.\n  - `/src/lib/firebase-admin.ts` \342\200\224 Firebase Admin SDK setup using static JSON import of `../../firebase-applet-config.json`.\n  - `/src/middleware/auth.ts` \342\200\224 `requireAuth` and `optionalAuth` Express middleware.\n  - `/src/db/schema.ts` \342\200\224 All 11 required PostgreSQL tables (`profiles`, `media_items`, `watch_rooms`, `watchlists`, `watchlist_items`, `room_members`, `playback_states`, `chat_messages`, `room_reactions`, `room_votes`, `watch_sessions`) with UUID primary keys, foreign keys, and indexes.\n  - `/src/db/drizzle.config.ts` \342\200\224 Drizzle Kit config using `SQL_HOST`, `SQL_DB_NAME`, `SQL_ADMIN_USER`, `SQL_ADMIN_PASSWORD`.\n  - `/src/db/index.ts` \342\200\224 PostgreSQL Pool using the Object Method (`SQL_HOST`, `SQL_USER`, `SQL_PASSWORD`, `SQL_DB_NAME`).\n  - `/src/db/users.ts` \342\200\224 `getOrCreateProfile` upsert repository helper.\n  - Ran `cloudsql.UpdateSchema` and verified all 11 tables in `information_schema.columns` via `cloudsql.ExecuteSql`.\n\n## 3. Key Findings\n- **`nxsha.space` Discovery & Embed Structure**:\n  - `https://nxsha.space/api/home-feed?tabKey=home` returns JSON with `sliderItems` and `fetchedSections` containing real TMDB IDs, titles, years, ratings, and descriptions (e.g., `The Shawshank Redemption` `278`, `The Godfather` `238`, `Cyberpunk: Edgerunners` `105248`, `Breaking Bad` `1396`, `The Apothecary Diaries` `220542`, `Clayface` `1400940`, `Spider-Man: Brand New Day` `969681`).\n  - The watch page on `nxsha.space` embeds `<iframe src=\"https://nxsha.space/embed/movie/{id}\">` and `<iframe src=\"https://nxsha.space/embed/tv/{id}/{season}/{episode}\">`.\n- **Image Generation Quota**:\n  - Calling `generate_image` returned `RESOURCE_EXHAUSTED` earlier due to quota limits; do NOT call `generate_image` again. Use our resilient deterministic SVG cinema poster/backdrop renderer (`MediaPoster.tsx`) so there are zero broken images and zero failed external image requests.\n- **Database Import Rules**:\n  - All relative imports for database/backend files in `server.ts` and `src/db/*.ts` MUST include the `.ts` extension (e.g. `import { db } from \'./src/db/index.ts\';`) to satisfy ES Module resolution (`\"type\": \"module\"`).\n\n## 4. Active Context\n- Files from the earlier prototype (`/src/types.ts`, `/src/data/catalog.ts`, `/src/utils/streamEngine.ts`, `/src/utils/streamEngine.test.ts`, `/src/components/*`, `/src/App.tsx`, `/server.ts`, `/index.html`, `/metadata.json`, `/.env.example`) exist and need to be updated/refactored into the **CineTogether** architecture with React Router, `MediaProviderAdapter`, Cloud SQL repository helpers, WebSocket synchronization (`revision`, drift correction), Couple Mode, and Group Mode.\n\n## 5. Next Steps\n1. **Create Database Repository & Seed Layer (`/src/db/repository.ts`) + Update `/.env.example`, `/metadata.json`, and `/index.html`**:\n   - Write Drizzle type-safe repository methods with two-layer error handling (plus graceful fallback to in-memory/demo state if a guest is in demo mode) for `profiles`, `media_items`, `watch_rooms`, `room_members`, `playback_states`, `chat_messages`, `room_reactions`, `room_votes`, `watchlists`, `watchlist_items`, and `watch_sessions` (hashing room passwords with SHA-256 so plaintext passwords are never stored).\n2. **Create Pure Logic & `MediaProviderAdapter` (`/src/utils/mediaAdapter.ts`, `/src/utils/syncEngine.ts`, `/src/utils/syncEngine.test.ts`)**:\n   - Implement `MediaProviderAdapter` interface with two concrete adapters: `Html5SyncVideoAdapter` (full programmatic control + canvas/WebM/MP4 sample stream) and `NxshaEmbedAdapter` (`/embed/movie/{id}` and `/embed/tv/{id}/{season}/{episode}` with honest `supportsProgrammaticSync = false`).\n   - Implement pure playback synchronization logic (revision comparison, stale-event rejection, small drift vs large drift correction, password hashing, room code generation) and unit tests (`node:test`).\n3. **Update `/server.ts`**:\n   - Mount REST API routes (`/api/catalog`, `/api/rooms`, `/api/rooms/:code/join`, `/api/watchlist`, `/api/profile`, `/api/sessions`) backed by Drizzle (`src/db/repository.ts`) + `optionalAuth`/`requireAuth`.\n   - Mount WebSocket server (`/ws/room`) implementing server-authoritative `playback_states` with `revision` increments, join-in-progress sync, chat broadcast & DB persistence, emoji/heart reactions, movie voting, host transfer, room lock/kick, and WebRTC signaling relay (`webrtc:offer`, `webrtc:answer`, `webrtc:ice`).\n4. **Build Modular Frontend Components & All 14 Required Routes (`/src/App.tsx` and `/src/components/*`)**:\n   - Configurable brand constant `BRAND_CONFIG = { name: \'CineTogether\', tagline: \'Different places. One screen. Shared moments.\' }`.\n   - Persistent navigation bar (`Home | Movies | TV Shows | Anime | My List | Watch Parties` + `Create Watch Party` CTA).\n   - Implement all 14 pages/routes including `CoupleRoom`, `GroupRoom`, `WatchPartyModeSelector`, `MediaDetail`, `Watchlist`, `Profile`, `AuthPage`, and `NotFound`.\n5. **Run Ultra-Mode Verification Loop**:\n   - Run unit tests via `npx --yes tsx --test`.\n   - Run `compile_applet` and `restart_dev_server`.\n   - Inspect desktop (`1440x900`) and mobile (`390x844`) viewports and test key user journeys (browse catalog, create Couple Room, join room, create Group Room, send real-time chat & reactions, toggle watchlist, test synced vs external embed player states) using `playwright-cli`.\n\n## 6. Commitments & Constraints\n- **UI Isolation (`cloudsql-setup`)**: Do NOT expose raw SQL query logs or database connection telemetry in the UI; only provide a clean Demo/Guest Mode vs Signed-In indicator as requested by the user prompt.\n- **Honest Sync Status**: Never claim frame-accurate synchronization when the user switches to the cross-origin Nxsha iframe embed (`NxshaEmbedAdapter`); display the clear `\"Sync unavailable for this external player\"` banner with manual coordination controls, while providing full real-time synchronization on the `Html5SyncVideoAdapter` player.\n</summary>"
