  planner_response {
    thinking: "**Developing Watch Party**\n\nI\'m currently focused on upgrading `/src/components/WatchPartyWorkspace.tsx`. The goal is to build out a dynamic real-time cinema experience that caters to both couples and larger groups, depending on the selected mode. Additionally, I\'m working on a mode selector to allow users to create or join watch parties effectively.\n\n\n"
