  user_input {
    user_response: "Now audit the entire CineTogether application as a senior QA engineer. Do not redesign the existing UI unnecessarily.\n\nRun the app, inspect the project files, fix build errors, and test every route and interactive control.\n\nPrioritize the complete Couple Watch Party and Group Watch Party flows, real database persistence, invite links, room membership, real-time chat, participant presence, and supported playback synchronization.\n\nUse two independent browser sessions to test room creation and joining. Fix any issues discovered.\n\nVerify the Nxsha embed integration against its currently documented interface. Do not claim that playback synchronization works unless the selected player actually exposes the necessary controls and events. Preserve a functional demo player when external integration is unavailable.\n\nRemove dead buttons, broken routes, fake success messages, and placeholder functionality presented as real. Keep clear demo-mode indicators wherever backend credentials or provider access are missing.\n\nFinish by listing verified working features, known limitations, environment variables, and exact deployment steps. Make the application build successfully before finishing."
    items {
      text: "Now audit the entire CineTogether application as a senior QA engineer. Do not redesign the existing UI unnecessarily.\n\nRun the app, inspect the project files, fix build errors, and test every route and interactive control.\n\nPrioritize the complete Couple Watch Party and Group Watch Party flows, real database persistence, invite links, room membership, real-time chat, participant presence, and supported playback synchronization.\n\nUse two independent browser sessions to test room creation and joining. Fix any issues discovered.\n\nVerify the Nxsha embed integration against its currently documented interface. Do not claim that playback synchronization works unless the selected player actually exposes the necessary controls and events. Preserve a functional demo player when external integration is unavailable.\n\nRemove dead buttons, broken routes, fake success messages, and placeholder functionality presented as real. Keep clear demo-mode indicators wherever backend credentials or provider access are missing.\n\nFinish by listing verified working features, known limitations, environment variables, and exact deployment steps. Make the application build successfully before finishing."
