  planner_response {
    thinking: "**Initiating QA Testing**\n\nI\'m setting up a robust QA process using `run_command` with `playwright-cli`, utilizing two independent browser sessions (-s=host and -s=partner). I will also include database verification through `cloudsql.ExecuteSql` for comprehensive coverage. I\'m focusing on the `playwright-cli` session testing, to begin with.\n\n\n**Refining Browser Sessions**\n\nI\'ve refined the browser session testing. My focus has sharpened to include a series of verifications within the `-s=host` session, starting with a clean console and error check at `http://localhost:3000`. I\'m then navigating to the creation flow, verifying the availability of couple and group modes. I\'m also capturing room codes and screenshots upon launching a room.\n\n\n"
    tool_calls {
      id: "call_4065973"
